#!/bin/bash
# PBS array job: workers for a validation/workqueue.py queue on /import/taiji1.
#
# Submit from headnode; the same queue can be worked at the same time from
# orr / cartman / stan (backfill):
#
#   qsub -v QUEUE=/import/taiji1/wardak/queues/NAME validation/pbs/queue_worker.pbs
#   python validation/workqueue.py work $QUEUE --workers 18 --nice   # on cartman, say
#   python validation/workqueue.py status $QUEUE
#
# Each array task is one single-core worker; it stops taking tasks 30 min
# before its walltime, and tasks of killed workers are rerun by others.
#
# defaultQ: at most 48 cores per user; default walltime 2 h, so set it here.
#PBS -N vlink-queue
#PBS -q defaultQ
#PBS -l select=1:ncpus=1:mem=4gb
#PBS -l walltime=12:00:00
#PBS -J 0-47
#PBS -j oe
#PBS -o /import/taiji1/wardak/queues/pbs-logs/

set -euo pipefail
cd /import/taiji1/wardak/cat0-vertex-link/CAT0
source ~/envs/cat0-vertex-link/bin/activate
python validation/workqueue.py work "$QUEUE" --workers 1 --hours 11.5
